msgid "By default, every Post Selection is a <a target='_blank' href='https://docs.advanced-views.com/post-selections/code-fields/javascript-code'>web component</a>, which allows you to work easily with the element in the JS code field. <br><br> Set it to 'None' if you're going to use the <a target='_blank' href='https://docs.advanced-views.com/post-selections/component-options/interactivity-api'>WP Interactivity API</a>."
