#: src/Acf/Groups/translations.php:476
msgid "Write your own template with full control over the HTML markup. <br> Copy the Default Template code and make your changes. <br><br> Check out our Docs to learn more about the <a target='_blank' href='https://docs.advanced-views.com/features/smart-templates'>available template engines</a>. <br><br> Press Ctrl (Cmd) + Alt + L to format the code. Press Ctrl + F to search (or replace). <br><br> Make sure you've retained all the default classes; otherwise, pagination won't work."
